    "body": "/cc @kenjibaheux\r\n\r\nThis makes sense. I think it may be interesting (at a later point) to also add a header to control the viewport, such as the one [proposed](https://discourse.wicg.io/t/proposal-viewport-http-header/3233) a few years back. That would enable such hints to actually be early ones.",
